    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Bounded streaming cleanup of roleplay artifacts in Generate / GenerateAndSpeak output (speaker prefixes and paired markup spans). All flags default off. Budgets are UTF-8 byte counts. Missing wire sub-table is treated by the server as an explicit all-default/off table; generated clients still materialize the sub-table (same invariant as SamplingOverrides). No on_change — nodes read live params at Execute. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
